<title>SWEDEN: Swedish PM to reshuffle cabinet Tuesday - radio.</title>
<headline>Swedish PM to reshuffle cabinet Tuesday - radio.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Prime Minister Goran Persson was to announce a reshuffle of his cabinet later on Tuesday, Swedish radio reported.</p>
<p>Swedish Radio was quoting the on-line pages of political daily newspaper Dagens Politik.</p>
